  "idea": "Obsidian: build an interconnected personal knowledge base for free",
  "text": "Stop losing track of ideas, articles, and book notes across ten different apps. Bookmark folders and note apps quickly become digital graveyards where valuable insights go to die. Without unified links, you spend more time organizing empty templates than applying what you learn. Instead, centralize your reading workflow into Obsidian using community plugins like Readwise and Dataview. You synthesize complex ideas in half the time while retaining every insight.",
